script = ExtResource("1_script")
BooScene = ExtResource("3_boo")
metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 164: the BOOLOSSUS of King Boo's Smash (KINGBOO_REMATCH_gdoc.txt, attack 2). King Boo makes one over Mario (his crown glows white first); it hangs DropHeight up for HangSeconds drifting after Mario (its shadow on the floor is the tell), falls under SmashGravity, and on landing hits Mario inside its body (the plain hit) and splits into WaveCount Boos that ride outward at WaveSpeed, WaveHeight over the floor, for WaveSeconds (each the plain hit; a jump clears them), then vanish. Pass 215: the body is the game's SLEEPY BOO (the Model child: models/Eniemes/Telesa/debutelesa.glb in its own materials, snoring through its one clip) and the landing plays its EATEN sound; to bring the Boolossus back, set the Model child's scene to models/Sms/Rematch/boolossus.glb, turn GhostLook on and empty ModelClip. Knobs: The look (BodySize = metres across, GhostLook, Opacity / Lift / Glow for the ghost look, ModelClip / ModelClipFrames, FacesPlusZ, the shadow, LandingMark / MarkColor), The dive (DiveHeight, DiveDistance, FadeInSeconds, SmashGravity, TrackSpeed, LockSeconds, DiveTilt, BodyRadius 0 = half of BodySize, BodyHitHeight), The wave (WaveCount, WaveBooScale 1 = the hotel Boo's own size, WaveSpeed, WaveSeconds, WaveHeight, WaveFadeSeconds, WaveStartRadius 0 = the body's radius, BooFacesPlusZ, BooRadius, WaveBooOpacity, BooClip; the Boos are the port's hotel Boo, telesa.glb), The sounds (LandSe, SplitSe, AppearSe, WaveGoneSe). King Boo's side (the tell, the chance) is on KingBoo under The fight (164)."

[node name="Model" parent="." instance=ExtResource("2_model")]
